  vng.c is in this package and at
  https://github.com/mu-files/mufusion/tree/main/muraw-demosaic/c-src/demosaic

- RCD demosaicing (c-src/demosaic/rcd.txt), based on the implementation by
  Luis Sanz Rodríguez (https://github.com/LuisSR/RCD-Demosaicing), is under
  the GNU General Public License v3 or later. See LICENSES/LICENSE-GPL-3.0.
  It is not built unless it is renamed to rcd.c; a build that includes it
  is under the GPL v3 as a whole.


